{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act39side_level_act39side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act39side",
  "stageId": "act39side_01",
  "title": "倒悬苍白海上",
  "storyCode": "EP-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act39side/level_act39side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2a057aa153c31e2334af6b34098416358568431ba5ec92a2dae9953e3892edbe",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "哟，帕斯卡拉，你终于来了。我还以为你死在盐漠里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "看你这惨白的小脸，路上遇到什么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "闭嘴，蒂奇......快点让我进去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "想进来？首领要的东西你拿到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "当然，不止罗盘，我还有另外一个大发现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "胡安娜女士一直在找的炼金术师，我也有线索了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "现在我能进去了吗，蒂奇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "当然，神偷帕斯卡拉小姐，您的光临让寒舍蓬荜生辉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "升起船帆嘿，收起船锚嘿♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "让狂风撕扯我们的衣衫♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "让暴雨浇醒我们的酒意♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "准备！出发！港口的船有千千万万只！♪"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天亮我们将第一个冲向大♪......\n啊啊——你谁？！为什么会蹲在我家？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "老伯，这条小巷......是你家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "小伙子，你现在顶的纸板就是我的床......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "对不起，我看它在垃圾桶旁，以为没人要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我能在你家暂避下雨吗？天亮我就离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "镇上都两个月没见一滴雨了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "就算要下雨，你能不能先放下我的床？喏，这是我的被子，你拿去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......谢谢，先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "你是来干什么的，阿戈尔人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我在找一种本地流传的剑术，传说最早创立这种剑术的......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "几个月前，我听说了这种“能与风浪相搏”的特异剑术，想来学习。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "真是胆子大，不知道审判庭的人到今天还戒备着海盗吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我对海盗不感兴趣，只是觉得自己的剑术有欠缺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "剑是用来砍人的，不是用来砍水的，更何况，你学了干什么？出海吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "你问太多了，老伯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "唉......总有人信这种傻事。你要是早来半年，我还能带你去见见那个老家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "他当年跟那群海盗学了一招两式，天天吵吵着自己能劈开巨浪。最后还不是跟我一样，跑回镇子里安安稳稳地等死？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "他死前有留下什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "他的日记？都带进坟里啦，自己挖去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蹒跚的老人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "那家伙要是知道有人想学自己的剑术，肯定高兴得要从坟里爬出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "将锹子竖在一旁，伊西多掀开棺材板，拨开落入其中的盐粒，一具外表晶亮，色泽红润的尸体露了出来。\n尸体的衣袋中露出书册的一角。\n伊西多小心翼翼捏住，将它取出，尽全力保护因盐分侵蚀而异常脆弱的纸张碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "这就是那位先生说的日记吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "碎得什么都看不出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "咳咳咳......噗——呸呸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......碎纸片都吹进嘴里了，好咸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "去别的地方再找找吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "别的地方？你这十恶不赦的盗墓贼、食人犯，还想去哪里作恶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "盗墓贼？食人犯？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "一路上看你鬼鬼祟祟地摸到墓地里来，这下让我逮了个正着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我可以解释，这位先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "“这位先生”......？你甚至不认识我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "您是当地什么很有名的人物吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "审判庭教士，平时负责在镇门口检查所有来客的通行许可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "如果你不认识我，那你是怎么进来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "把这家伙给我抓起来！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "花瓣碾碎到这种程度就可以了吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "亚诺阿医生！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "哦，哦！差不多了，再碾几下就可以兑油搅拌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "你怎么手抖了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "是您眼花了，医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "花什么生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "我说！是您眼花了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "啊，碾花？你不是就在碾花？看你这手抖得......又偷偷喝酒了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "你是镇上的证裁官，最不该喝酒。酒是害人的孽物，这都是你自己布讲的教义。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "和运酒的商队代表坐在一张桌子上谈生意，总要喝几杯，都是为了给镇子谋出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "医生，那个寡妇情况怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "谁......大点声！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "老陶匠留下的寡妇！这几天快要生孩子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "亚诺阿",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_179",
      "text": "生花籽？啊对，熟了就种不出来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我说！\n寡妇！！\n要生孩子！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "西尔弗阁下————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "啊——！吓死了，我说过进来之前要敲门的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "我听到您在大喊，以为您遇到了危险！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "我没事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "那个，除此外......我还有事报告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "我们在镇东的坟场里抓到了一个......一个疯子，一个亵渎者，正在偷盗镇民的尸体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "这......我以为只要食物充足，当年那样的惨剧就不会重演。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "西尔弗阁下，抱歉这么说，但光饱腹是不够的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "当年是您带来神圣的律法，祛除了人们身负的罪孽。可现在呢？不仅禁令都取消了，连您的布道，我们也很久没听到过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "罪孽重新滋生，也在所难免。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "你这样觉得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "所以您绝不能让这十恶不赦的亵渎者在镇子里散布罪孽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "......安排行刑吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "老巴洛呢？有人看到老巴洛和亵渎者聊了很久......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "......不必了。老巴洛年轻的时候是与海盗接触过，但他没有为非作歹的胆子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "可——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "我说，不必了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "阁下......我认为我们至少有必要盯着他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "再说吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恐惧的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "挖坟......他难道是想，他难道是想......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇恨的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "作孽啊，作孽啊！雅隆不再纯洁了......灾厄又要降临了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仇恨的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "教士大人，证裁官大人！求你们杀死他，祛除他的罪孽，别让当年那样的灾祸再来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "（扭动）"
    },
    {
