      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "事多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "哎，你、你干什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "将女孩夹在腋下，伊西多回头看了一眼身后。\n随后，他果断转过头，带着不停尖叫的女孩跃下。"
