      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "鳞屎坨子，我绝对不会放过你————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "啊————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "惊慌间，帕斯卡拉感觉自己落入了柔软之中，而非自己所预想的坚硬地面。\n睁开眼睛，她发现自己被一张巨大的布料接住。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "啊......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我们已经安全了，他们用船帆接住了我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "呃？悬崖底下......有船。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "环顾四周，帕斯卡拉看到庞大的骨骸支撑起了木质的船身，帆布与鳞皮接成的风帆层层叠叠，切碎了日光。\n通过复杂的传动结构，炽烈的风驱使着船体下繁复的步足，坚定有力地踏过盐地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“平凡”的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_461_1",
      "text": "就这个胆量，你还自称神偷吗，帕斯卡拉小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "哈，当窃贼需要周密的计划与谨慎的思考，不是莽撞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "蒂奇，别跟那丫头费嘴皮子了，赶紧换身衣服来帮我，舵手刚刚受伤了，你得来接手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "正好，我也嫌那套衣服太拘束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狰狞的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "呼......呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "嗯？你背着什么东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狰狞的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "食物和水！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狰狞的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "刚刚看到他们的粮仓，顺手拿了点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "狰狞的船员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1591_1",
      "text": "走之前再顺手放了把火，哈哈！这会儿肯定都忙着救火，没心思管我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "嗨......混账小子，干得不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蒂奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1580_1",
      "text": "姑娘们，小伙子们，再出点力气！咱们明天晚上就到家了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "小子，趴在栏杆上看什么呢？第一次来苍白海？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "这艘船......很奇特。几乎完全由木材与骨头构成......应该比一般的陆行舰轻得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "当然，这片盐漠就只有我们的盐船可以穿行其中，外面那些沉重的铁皮怪物，恐怕一进来就会陷下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "真是神奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "你看起来一点也不害怕。没听到镇子里的人管我们叫什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "你们是强盗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "脱口而出，真是胆大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "将我从绞刑架上救下来的也是你们，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "为什么跟我们一起逃走？这样的话，在镇民眼里，你也是个强盗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......你们知道一种能和海上的风浪搏击的剑术吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "什么剑术？你是在开玩笑吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "没人知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "从没听过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "你们的舰船会停在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "你想离开？恐怕不行，你要和我们一起回到聚落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "......抱歉，我没有这样的打算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "你怎么想可不重要，小子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "请别这么说，我不想对自己的救命恩人拔剑相向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "我知道你的剑术不错，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "警觉心就差一点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "嘿，我做贼这些年，可没一个人能注意到我的动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "这一剂迷烟下去，足够他睡一路了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "帕斯卡拉小姐，别太得意。首领要的罗盘在哪里？为了救你我们花的力气不少，可别让人失望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "这么说我就伤心了，我带给你们的可不止罗盘啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "（努嘴）不还有那位老兄吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "算上他的话，你救下我所花的力气可就不够看了，得再多给点吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "难道你一张嘴说他是炼金术师，他就是吗？到了地方，等首领核实过他的身份再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "无所谓，该进我兜里的东西迟早都会进来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "厨房在哪里？刚刚死里逃生，我可得找点吃的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈维尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1579_1",
      "text": "船尾二层。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕斯卡拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4163_rosesa_1",
      "text": "谢谢你的慷慨！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊恐的习武教士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊啊啊————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "我只是要把伤口上扎的骨刺挑出来，不会锯了你的腿。"
