    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "要生了，西尔弗大人，寡妇要生了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "不知道是不是受了那些强盗的惊吓，能不能让医生先去看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "......医生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "别问了。我亲自去。"
