    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "别晃她了，她醒不过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "大人，我......大人，她......大人，孩子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "孩子也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "着急的镇民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_187",
      "text": "大人，您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "教士，看好尸体，明早入土。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "备好驮兽，葬礼结束之后，你立刻动身去找亚诺阿的儿子，无论如何都要请他回镇上来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "镇上不能没有医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "习武教士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1587_1",
      "text": "阁下，我记得您跟亚诺阿医生学过些医术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "一个刚刚学会做药膏的人，当不了医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "不然，寡妇和孩子也不会死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "去办吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透过紧闭的窗，雅隆的人们能看到一抹淡粉色的灯火飘过雾气浓重的街道。\n西尔弗不知道天色是什么时候暗下来的，他觉得自己方才还迎着朝阳，为当天的行刑仪式整理衣装。\n而现在，身上被血糊得一塌糊涂，不是盗贼与亵渎者的血，而是镇民的血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "............"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "毫无征兆，在街道另一侧，西尔弗瞥见了另一抹淡粉色的灯火。\n一个瘦高的男人，腹部有一个血淋淋的洞，西尔弗甚至能透过它看见远处。\n男人若无其事地向他走来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "您需要我的帮助吗，先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "您的伤看起来很严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "我很好，证裁官先生，看您的脸色很差......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安纳斯塔西奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1582_1",
      "text": "我是新调来的执裁官，请问有什么能帮您吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "西尔弗",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1583_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "胡安娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1581_1",
      "text": "想不到你被倒挂着也能睡得很香，小家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊西多",
      "speakerId": "avg_293_thorns_1",
      "text": "我经常这样做，没多难。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
